<title>USA: Tennessee postpones $25 mln GO bond deal.</title>
<headline>Tennessee postpones $25 mln GO bond deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tennessee postponed a $25 million general obligation bond deal originally set for competitive sale Wednesday.</p>
<p>The state said, however, that it would go ahead with a $172.8 million GO deal Wednesday, set for sale at 1030 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
